    "description": "Perched atop a beautifully reimagined Victorian on a coveted, tree-lined slow street, this light-filled 2-bedroom, 1-bathroom top-floor flat blends modern comfort with timeless charm. The primary bedroom features a striking turret and Juliette balcony, ideal for morning coffee. Vaulted ceilings and wide-plank oak floors enhance the spacious interior, complemented by stainless steel appliances, custom cabinetry, and designer finishes throughout. Additional conveniences include a large storage closet, in-unit washer and dryer, and access to a shared yard. Located in an intimate four-unit building just one block from the Panhandle, this residence offers a unique, personalized living experience within a classic architectural setting. Included is a prepaid parking lease for several months after closing, located just across the street. Near Golden Gate Park, the Haight, Divisadero Corridor, Cole Valley, and NOPA, it perfectly combines historic character with contemporary urban living."
  },
